WEBVTT

00:10.530 --> 00:15.050
JUJUTSU KAISEN
Shibuya Incident

01:44.480 --> 01:46.010
Do you remember

01:47.570 --> 01:50.710
the ways to rid cursed 
spirits from our world?

01:53.620 --> 01:56.200
Regardless of which method is pursued,

01:56.200 --> 02:00.120
it means advancing humanity 
to the next stage.

02:01.420 --> 02:05.760
Now, I need to buy time for Larue to act.

02:07.590 --> 02:09.930
Humanity's next stage is

02:09.930 --> 02:13.150
freeing itself from cursed energy.

02:15.090 --> 02:18.120
No. It's optimizing cursed energy.

02:23.500 --> 02:26.410
Uh, I don't get it, either.

02:26.800 --> 02:32.920
I thought you already gave on your plan 
twelve years ago, when Zen'in Toji died.

02:32.920 --> 02:35.920
I was talking to Geto-kun, you know.

02:36.970 --> 02:38.670
Well, whatever.

02:39.510 --> 02:41.660
I went back to my original idea.

02:41.660 --> 02:45.290
Besides, there's a big hole 
in your optimization plan.

02:45.680 --> 02:51.310
Extremely few sorcerers and cursed spirits 
emerge in other countries compared to Japan.

02:52.190 --> 02:57.430
So Tengen's barriers should be 
indispensable to your optimization plan.

02:58.500 --> 03:02.470
Using Tengen to optimize 
cursed energy would mean

03:02.470 --> 03:05.920
only the humans of this nation 
would become sorcerers.

03:06.840 --> 03:11.330
Japan would practically have 
a monopoly on cursed energy.

03:12.100 --> 03:16.000
Other nations, especially that superpower, 
wouldn't stand by and allow that.

03:17.110 --> 03:19.760
Flesh-and-blood humans 
would become an energy source.

03:19.760 --> 03:24.010
It's easy enough to imagine 
what misfortune that would bring.

03:26.350 --> 03:30.520
That's a world far removed 
from the ideals I pursue.

03:32.590 --> 03:34.140
So what?

03:34.830 --> 03:37.400
For one thing, our objectives are different.

03:37.820 --> 03:40.160
I don't desire a world 
without cursed spirits

03:40.380 --> 03:43.160
or any sort of idyllic peace.

03:43.420 --> 03:46.800
Non-sorcerers, sorcerers, cursed spirits...

03:46.800 --> 03:49.660
Those are all possibilities

03:49.660 --> 03:52.540
for the shape of cursed 
energy that is mankind.

03:54.280 --> 03:58.390
Though that shouldn't be 
anywhere near the full extent.

03:58.940 --> 04:01.170
I tried to give rise

04:01.170 --> 04:03.940
to other possibilities 
for mankind on my own.

04:07.930 --> 04:10.540
But that didn't work out.

04:10.540 --> 04:12.420
Everything that I created myself

04:12.660 --> 04:15.340
was limited by the bounds 
of my own potential.

04:15.780 --> 04:21.110
The answer was always 
glimmering darkly within chaos.

04:21.800 --> 04:23.200
Do you understand?

04:23.200 --> 04:25.300
What I should have created

04:25.300 --> 04:28.410
was chaos that went 
beyond my own control.

04:28.840 --> 04:32.410
I've already finished 
extracting the technique.

04:34.550 --> 04:36.680
There was a cursed spirit 
called Mahito, right?!

04:36.680 --> 04:39.260
The one with the technique 
that let it interfere with souls!

04:39.260 --> 04:41.050
That guy absorbed it earlier.

04:41.050 --> 04:42.340
Seriously?!

04:44.930 --> 04:46.850
Idle Transfiguration.

05:08.610 --> 05:12.710
Tengen's barrier? No, this is...

05:12.920 --> 05:15.330
Remote activation of a cursed technique?!

05:15.330 --> 05:18.920
You have my thanks, Yuji Itadori.

05:18.920 --> 05:23.420
A cursed spirit's mastery of 
their technique ceases to progress

05:23.420 --> 05:26.800
from the moment they're absorbed 
by Cursed Spirit Manipulation.

05:27.100 --> 05:30.300
Mahito truly matured 
through his fight with you.

05:30.860 --> 05:35.760
To be honest, I wanted to have 
Jogo, as well, but no matter.

05:36.420 --> 05:38.140
What did you do?

05:38.420 --> 05:41.330
I remotely activated 
Idle Transfiguration on

05:41.330 --> 05:44.250
two types of non-sorcerers 
that I marked ahead of time.

05:51.080 --> 05:56.960
Tsumiki Fushiguro

06:10.060 --> 06:14.060
One type was people whom I had absorb 
cursed objects like Yuji Itadori did,

06:14.650 --> 06:18.540
and the other was people like Junpei 
Yoshino who have cursed techniques,

06:18.540 --> 06:21.560
but whose brains were 
structured like non-sorcerers.

06:21.560 --> 06:25.320
Now I've adjusted their brains 
to match those of sorcerers.

06:25.830 --> 06:28.450
For the former, I gave them 
the strength to be vessels,

06:28.450 --> 06:32.580
and the latter have obtained the 
ability to activate their techniques.

06:33.880 --> 06:35.220
And now...

06:38.440 --> 06:42.330
I've released the seal 
on those cursed objects.

06:43.050 --> 06:45.540
Some of them have been in a deep sleep

06:45.540 --> 06:48.360
after being exposed to my 
cursed energy when I marked them,

06:48.360 --> 06:50.360
but they'll soon awaken.

06:51.700 --> 06:53.660
So, starting now,

06:53.660 --> 06:57.800
I'll have them kill each other in order to 
deepen their understanding of cursed energy.

06:58.440 --> 07:01.630
I've carefully hand-picked 
these people and cursed objects.

07:01.630 --> 07:06.660
Think of it as unleashing a 
thousand malevolent Yuji Itadoris.

07:07.360 --> 07:08.950
A thousand?

07:08.950 --> 07:10.220
That's conservative.

07:10.580 --> 07:13.210
You're also underestimating 
human rationality.

07:13.710 --> 07:15.350
Do you think people will start

07:15.350 --> 07:17.960
killing each other just because 
they were granted power?

07:18.340 --> 07:20.840
There's an order to everything.

07:21.160 --> 07:25.020
I certainly didn't cut corners like 
that when making my preparations.

07:25.460 --> 07:27.880
Your questions are starting 
to become shallow.

07:30.880 --> 07:33.440
He's pissing me off, 
so let's all beat him up together!

07:33.440 --> 07:35.950
I can't move right now, though...

07:42.100 --> 07:44.610
What's the matter, Uraume?

07:44.810 --> 07:47.860
I regenerated my body with 
a reverse cursed technique...

07:48.240 --> 07:49.260
This is...

07:49.570 --> 07:50.480
Poison?!

07:51.240 --> 07:54.120
My blood got mixed with 
yours through Piercing Blood.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.240
Of course it is.

07:55.800 --> 07:58.600
Wait, we're not getting cover from Mai-chan.

07:58.600 --> 08:01.180
They might still have 
more allies over there.

08:02.500 --> 08:08.000
My ally is protecting Aoi, 
the girl with the gun, and that suit.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.380
They don't belong here.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.200
Can you move?

08:11.200 --> 08:12.220
Yeah.

08:12.220 --> 08:14.730
I can adjust my body heat.

08:14.730 --> 08:15.880
No problems here.

08:17.760 --> 08:20.140
I'm so done.

08:20.540 --> 08:22.640
We were in the middle of our talk.

08:23.230 --> 08:27.080
The cursed objects that I distributed 
are what's left of the sorcerers

08:27.080 --> 08:30.460
I've been secretly making pacts 
with for a thousand years.

08:30.460 --> 08:34.960
Of course, I forged my pacts 
with more than just sorcerers,

08:36.170 --> 08:41.790
though my pacts with those were 
annulled when I obtained this body.

08:43.480 --> 08:44.790
You don't mean...

08:45.120 --> 08:49.260
This is the world of the future.

09:40.660 --> 09:43.470
See you later, Yuji Itadori.

09:45.650 --> 09:48.150
Gojo-sensei!

09:50.830 --> 09:53.160
I have high expectations for you.

09:54.190 --> 09:56.480
Are you listening, Sukuna?

09:56.810 --> 09:57.980
It's starting once again.

09:59.140 --> 10:06.120
The world of Heian, 
the golden age of jujutsu!

10:25.010 --> 10:28.660
The following footage was recorded by 
our crew, who happened to be on-site

10:28.660 --> 10:33.280
reporting on a different matter at the 
time of the incident in Tokyo the other day.

10:33.280 --> 10:35.020
Please have a look.

10:36.300 --> 10:40.640
Uh, it's been about ten minutes 
since the blackout, I think?

10:40.640 --> 10:44.320
It's been a while, 
and the blackout continues.

10:40.930 --> 10:44.320
Something really crazy is going on.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.810
Sure it's not fake news?

10:44.320 --> 10:49.460
We still cannot contact the station, 
so the cause remains unknown,

10:45.810 --> 10:48.360
All the news is covering this, though.

10:48.360 --> 10:52.520
Hmm... Well, I'll be getting home 
late today, so have a frozen dinner.

10:49.460 --> 10:53.240
and we have practically 
no idea what's going on.

10:52.520 --> 10:54.340
Sure.

10:54.590 --> 10:57.420
All 23 wards are nearly wiped out.

10:57.420 --> 10:59.290
The safety of the Prime Minister's office,

10:59.290 --> 11:01.540
including the Chief Cabinet 
Secretary, remains uncertain.

11:01.540 --> 11:03.720
It's a political void!

11:03.720 --> 11:05.970
A literal hole!

11:06.280 --> 11:08.300
No matter how low we estimate it,

11:08.300 --> 11:11.320
we need to make a plan to evacuate 
at least five million citizens.

11:11.320 --> 11:14.980
Love hotels, campgrounds, ghost towns...

11:14.980 --> 11:19.260
Use whatever you can, as long as it 
has the bare minimum infrastructure.

11:19.260 --> 11:22.770
More importantly, how are we 
supposed to explain this to the residents?

11:22.770 --> 11:25.580
There's no point announcing anything 
when we don't know the cause!

11:26.370 --> 11:30.100
Also, the government has yet 
to make an announcement.

11:30.370 --> 11:32.700
Was this simply the 
malfunction of a substation?

11:32.700 --> 11:34.160
Was it terrorism?

11:34.370 --> 11:38.430
Or perhaps... it was a natural 
disaster, like an earthquake?

11:37.040 --> 11:39.100
Too many conspiracy theorists 
are crawling out.

11:38.760 --> 11:40.700
Either way, the cause remains unclear,

11:39.100 --> 11:41.630
Listen, would you put your phone 
away and come help me here?

11:40.700 --> 11:43.530
and we're being forced to wait 
while they uncover it.

11:41.640 --> 11:43.530
Very well.

11:43.980 --> 11:46.260
All we can firmly declare 
safe are portions of

11:46.260 --> 11:50.150
Okutama, Oume City, Akiruno City, Hachioji City,

11:50.150 --> 11:52.220
Machida City, and various islands.

11:52.220 --> 11:53.980
For now, you mean.

11:53.980 --> 11:57.130
The number of cursed spirits unleashed 
is no less than ten million.

11:57.130 --> 12:00.550
You want to enact an evacuation order 
on every ward of the entire city?

12:00.550 --> 12:02.980
Afterward, we declare 
the wards forbidden to entry.

12:02.980 --> 12:04.820
Make it a real uninhabited zone.

12:05.230 --> 12:07.600
More importantly, 
what about our announcement?

12:07.600 --> 12:08.840
Who's making it?

12:08.840 --> 12:11.800
Less "who" and more "how" to make it.

12:11.800 --> 12:13.830
We still can't get a hold 
of the deputy secretary?

12:14.590 --> 12:17.420
No, we can't.

12:17.420 --> 12:19.840
I haven't heard anything 
from his secretary, either.

12:21.940 --> 12:24.250
What should we do?

12:24.250 --> 12:27.700
Now, now, the upper brass 
will figure that out.

12:27.700 --> 12:31.530
For now, we need to establish 
contact with each ministry.

12:32.040 --> 12:34.540
The low yen ain't stopping.

12:34.540 --> 12:36.870
That was at least good for exports, right?

12:37.200 --> 12:38.940
The Japanese Business 
Federation has lost it?

12:38.940 --> 12:41.860
They won't be doing any 
lobbying if everyone's dead.

12:42.820 --> 12:45.360
Move the Prime Minister to Osaka!

12:45.360 --> 12:48.360
At this rate, there'll be a massive 
outbreak of cursed spirits everywhere!

12:48.710 --> 12:52.150
Most jujutsu sorcerers are already assigned 
to protecting evacuees in the city!

12:52.150 --> 12:53.540
And that outbreak is coming now!

12:53.540 --> 12:55.500
With a power vacuum of this scale,

12:55.500 --> 12:57.380
we may see military intervention 
from other nations.

12:57.380 --> 12:59.160
Yes. Huh?

12:59.160 --> 13:00.380
Oh, no.

13:00.380 --> 13:01.260
Yes.

13:02.310 --> 13:03.380
I understand.

13:06.040 --> 13:08.450
They're going to publicly announce 
the existence of cursed spirits.

13:08.450 --> 13:09.460
Huh?!

13:09.460 --> 13:11.720
They're going public with cursed spirits?!

13:11.720 --> 13:13.060
Are they seriously suggesting that?!

13:13.060 --> 13:17.270
Apparently, they intend to announce 
that cursed spirits only arise in Tokyo.

13:17.270 --> 13:20.230
So the goal is to direct the populace's 
leaking cursed energy to Tokyo

13:20.230 --> 13:23.400
and limit the outbreak of 
cursed spirits to there, huh?

13:23.400 --> 13:27.820
This is why I recommended Itami as a potential 
relocation site after Kansai Airport was built!

13:27.820 --> 13:30.100
Maybe it's better this way?

13:30.100 --> 13:33.800
They wouldn't have reached this decision 
if Kasumigaseki was functioning.

13:36.580 --> 13:39.570
Um, once again, we're sharing the latest.

13:39.570 --> 13:42.460
The blackout still continues as before,

13:42.480 --> 13:44.330
and we're unable to contact anyone.

13:44.330 --> 13:48.610
There's been no official announcement, either, 
so the cause remains unknown.

13:48.610 --> 13:51.840
The question is, how long will this last—hmm?

13:48.610 --> 14:04.360
LIVE               Unusual Phenomenon in the Capital? Damage Is Spreading

13:57.980 --> 14:00.550
What?  What is that?!

14:00.920 --> 14:01.940
Hey!

14:06.110 --> 14:08.110
Please wait a moment

14:08.110 --> 14:13.830
Please wait a moment

14:13.820 --> 14:16.310
Huh? What is this?

14:16.610 --> 14:17.880
A movie?

14:21.520 --> 14:25.160
The barrier centered around the Imperial 
Palace that was erected in the Meiji era,

14:25.160 --> 14:27.810
and the barrier centered directly 
above the Tombs of the Star Corridor,

14:27.810 --> 14:30.510
which was a proposed site for the 
relocation of Tokyo in the Bakumatsu era,

14:30.510 --> 14:33.690
will be forcibly expanded out 
to the borders of the prefecture.

15:42.290 --> 15:43.910
Come.

15:43.910 --> 15:45.650
Come.

15:45.650 --> 15:47.760
It's dangerous here.

15:57.300 --> 16:00.150
I have a warm bath.

16:05.010 --> 16:07.580
I can sing songs, too.

16:13.530 --> 16:15.400
What about my mom?

16:17.800 --> 16:20.420
Your mother, father,

16:20.420 --> 16:24.830
older sister, younger brother,
and teacher are all here.

16:27.510 --> 16:30.070
I don't have a younger brother.

16:30.070 --> 16:32.050
And I hate my teacher.

16:32.050 --> 16:35.990
I don't have a younger brother.

16:35.990 --> 16:40.470
And I hate my teacher.

16:41.560 --> 16:43.200
Are you okay?

16:43.200 --> 16:44.450
Need a drink?

16:49.560 --> 16:52.120
Please?

17:26.980 --> 17:28.070
Sorry.

17:29.640 --> 17:31.160
Did I scare you?

17:33.870 --> 17:35.070
Are you hurt?

17:37.960 --> 17:40.020
Were you with anyone?

17:41.240 --> 17:43.720
Like your mom or dad?

17:45.080 --> 17:46.360
I don't know.

17:47.540 --> 17:49.780
It's all commercial buildings here,

17:49.780 --> 17:51.670
so I guess she's not from around here?

17:53.200 --> 17:54.860
Did you walk a lot?

17:58.220 --> 18:01.110
I see. You worked hard.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.860
You can see them, huh?

18:11.800 --> 18:14.220
That's bad, Rika-chan.

18:15.140 --> 18:16.360
Don't overdo it.

18:18.830 --> 18:21.100
I'm sorry. I hesitated.

18:21.710 --> 18:24.600
I thought I should sit back and watch,

18:24.600 --> 18:27.750
and give him room to work, since the 
situation had already progressed so far.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.420
Have you realized yet?

18:30.420 --> 18:33.560
I'm not really on your side.

18:34.280 --> 18:39.320
I'm just a humble beauty who wants to 
eradicate cursed spirits from the world.

18:40.610 --> 18:42.870
It might not be much of an apology,

18:42.870 --> 18:48.480
but my allies and I will take responsibility 
for delivering the kids who were there.

18:50.220 --> 18:54.770
It's high time I confronted Tengen, too.

18:58.760 --> 19:00.320
What will you do?

19:07.460 --> 19:09.450
Good work, Okkotsu.

19:09.450 --> 19:11.640
You don't really intend to thank me,

19:11.640 --> 19:13.560
so let's just get to the point.

19:15.010 --> 19:19.220
Now you understand that 
I'll obey your orders, right?

19:20.950 --> 19:25.520
No amount of killing cursed 
spirits will prove anything.

19:26.630 --> 19:29.620
Then forge a pact or whatever you need to.

19:30.220 --> 19:33.020
It doesn't matter that he's 
one of Gojo-sensei's students.

19:34.360 --> 19:38.670
He cut off Inumaki-kun's arms in Shibuya.

19:40.120 --> 19:44.360
So I will kill Yuji Itadori.

19:46.410 --> 19:49.910
Notice from Jujutsu Headquarters

19:49.910 --> 19:57.920
1) Suguru Geto's survival was confirmed.
We hereby declare the reinstatement
of his death sentence.

19:57.920 --> 20:08.430
2) Satoru Gojo has been deemed an accomplice in the
Shibuya Incident and is hereby expelled from jujutsu society.
In addition, any attempt to free him from his seal will be deemed a crime.

20:08.430 --> 20:17.940
3) Masamichi Yaga is sentenced to death
for inciting Satoru Gojo and Suguru Geto,
causing the Shibuya Incident.

20:17.940 --> 20:25.450
4) The suspension on Yuji Itadori's
death sentence is hereby revoked, and his
execution shall be carried out promptly.

20:25.450 --> 20:32.960
5) Special-grade sorcerer Yuta Okkotsu
shall be appointed as Yuji Itadori's executioner.

22:07.010 --> 22:09.780
Episode 47
Shibuya Incident - Gate, Close

22:09.780 --> 22:10.030
To Be Continued
